        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion N2, Scalloped Two Piece Revere Grab Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA two piece handleset, Fusion's Revere Grab with Scalloped plates entry handle is designed with classic styles in mind. What brings this otherwise simple handleset to life are the handles--both the outside grab and the inside trim. The beaded grab of the handleset gives it a more modern feel without straying into the minimalistic appearance of the Contemporary Style. Instead, this handleset is very now, unlimited by the ornate style of times gone by and the stripped down approach of modernism. It has just the right amount of detailing on the outside plate's handle and the inside trim can range from detailed to very simple. Versatility is what this handleset is all about, made only more apparent by the fact that it is available in 4 finishes. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Beveled Edged Solid Brass Handleset Fusion N2:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Revere Grab Door Entry Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Two Piece Revere Grab Scalloped Handleset, Fusion N2",
                "description": "Two Piece Revere Grab Scalloped Handleset Fusion N2 - A two piece handleset, Fusion's Revere Grab with Scalloped plates entry handle is designed with classic styles in mind. What brings this otherwise simple handleset to life are the handles--both the outside grab and the inside trim. The beaded grab of the handleset gives it a more modern feel without straying into the minimalistic appearance of the Contemporary Style. Instead, this handleset is very now, unlimited by the ornate style of times gone by and the striped down approach of modernism. It has just the right amount of detailing on the outside plate's handle and the inside trim can range from detailed to very simple. Versatility is what this handleset is all about, made only more apparent by the fact that it is available in 4 finishes and will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
